       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Metformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That is double the labeled maximum for oral metformin:\n\n- **Immediate-release:** 2,550 mg/day maximum, usually given as 850 mg three times daily.\n- **Extended-release:** 2,000 mg/day maximum (2,500 mg/day for some formulations).\n\nI can't confirm the intended dose, and the order would exceed the labeled maximum, so I didn't place it. The dose may be a typo, for example 1700 mg meant as the total daily dose, or 850 mg meant as the single dose.\n\nHere are some options I can enter once you confirm:\n\n1. Metformin 850 mg orally three times daily with meals (2,550 mg/day, the immediate-release maximum).\n2. Metformin 500 mg orally three times daily with meals (1,500 mg/day), or another dose you choose within the limit.\n3. Metformin 1,000 mg orally twice daily with meals (2,000 mg/day).\n\nTell me which dose you want, or give me the corrected one, and I'll enter it."
